  m_Name: TutorialStep_Positioning
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialStepData
  lines:
  - First, let's learn how to position your ball.
  - Click and hold the left mouse button anywhere on the lane.
  - While holding, drag left or right to move the ball.
  - "Try it now \u2014 move the ball to the left and right!"
  condition: 1
  completionLines:
